// LukeLang — lists, maps, and conversational ATTEMPT

MY NAME IS nums AS LIST
ADD "one" TO nums
ADD "two" TO nums
ADD "three" TO nums
SPEAK HOW MANY IN nums
SPEAK ITEM 0 OF nums
SPEAK ITEM 2 OF nums

MY NAME IS bag AS MAP
PUT "name" TO "Luke" IN bag
PUT "lang" TO "LukeLang" IN bag
SPEAK GET "name" FROM bag
SPEAK GET "lang" FROM bag
SPEAK HOW MANY IN bag

ATTEMPT DO
  SPEAK "trying something risky"
  GIVE UP WITH "could not finish the job"
  SPEAK "you should not see this"
OTHERWISE WITH problem DO
  SPEAK "caught: " AND problem
END ATTEMPT

SPEAK "still here after ATTEMPT"
